{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>And first of my strength.</b> Even though a woman does not conceive from a first intercourse, nevertheless through pressure she conceives." "<b>Might and first of my strength, you are exceeding.</b> You were worthy to bear an extra share in my might and first of my strength, as is the law for a firstborn." "<b>My strength.</b> In the sense of wealth, as in ״מצאתי און לי״ and ״וידיו תשבנה אונו״." "<b>Exceeding.</b> Like לשאת, 'to bear.'"], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 49, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:09:07.719324409Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}